{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1743-p1","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《史记·李斯列传》（中华书局2014 年版）。李斯（？—前208），楚国上蔡（今属河南）人，荀子的弟子，入秦为客卿。前237 年，秦王嬴政接受宗室大臣建议，下令驱逐在秦的六国客卿。李斯身在被逐之列，于是作此书劝谏，为秦王采纳。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔缪（mù）公〕即秦穆公。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔西取由余于戎〕由余，原为戎王的臣子，后入秦，为秦穆公重用，帮助秦国攻灭西戎众多小国，称霸西戎。戎，古代对西部各少数民族的称呼。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔东得百里奚于宛（yuān）〕百里奚，原为虞大夫，虞亡时为晋所俘，作为晋献公女陪嫁之奴入秦。后逃亡到楚国宛（今河南南阳）地，为楚人所俘，秦穆公知道他有才能，以五张公羊皮将他赎回，授以国政，号“五羖（gǔ）大夫”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔迎蹇叔于宋〕蹇叔，百里奚的朋友，有才能。因百里奚荐举，秦穆公请他入秦，委任为上大夫。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔来丕豹、公孙支于晋〕来，招致、招揽。丕豹，晋国大夫丕郑之子，丕郑被晋惠公杀死后，丕豹投奔秦国，被秦穆公委任为大夫。公孙支，秦大夫。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔并〕兼并，吞并。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔孝公用商鞅之法〕孝公，即秦孝公，战国时秦国国君。他任用商鞅实行变法，使秦国日益富强，奠定了日后统一天下的基础。商鞅，公孙氏，名鞅，卫国人，战国时政治家。因功封于商（今陕西商洛东南），号商君，故称商鞅。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔殷盛〕殷实，富裕。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔乐用〕乐于为用。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔获楚、魏之师〕指战胜楚国、魏国的军队。前340 年，商鞅率军大败魏军，俘获魏公子卬（áng），逼迫魏割河西之地与秦。同年又南侵楚，战况不详，据此，当也是秦军获胜。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔举〕攻克，占领。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔治强〕安定强盛。治，社会安定。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔惠王用张仪之计〕惠王，即秦惠王，战国时秦国国君，孝公之子，初号惠文君，后称惠王。他任用张仪为相，采取连横策略，屡败魏、韩、赵、楚等国，降服巴、蜀，取得许多土地，使秦国更为强盛。张仪，战国时魏国人，纵横家。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔拔三川之地〕攻取三川之地。拔，攻取。三川之地，指黄河、洛水、伊水相交之地。秦惠王时，张仪请出兵三川，未能实现。至秦武王时攻取。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔巴、蜀〕巴，指巴国，在今四川东部和重庆一带；蜀，指蜀国，在今四川中部偏西一带。前316 年，秦惠王派张仪、司马错等率军攻灭巴、蜀，在其地分别设置巴郡、蜀郡。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔上郡〕原为魏郡，在今陕西北部，前328 年被魏割让给秦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔汉中〕原为楚地，在汉水中游一带，前312 年被秦攻取。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-18"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔包九夷〕吞并九夷之地。包，吞并、囊括。九夷，这里指当时楚国境内各少数民族所居之地。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-19"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔东据成皋之险〕在东面占有成皋这样的要隘。成皋，原为韩邑，在今河南荥阳，地势险要，前249年被秦攻取。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-20"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔散六国之从〕拆散六国结成的合纵。当时韩、魏、燕、赵、齐、楚六国联盟抗秦，称为合纵。从，同“纵”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-21"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔施（yì）〕延续。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-22"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔昭王得范雎，废穰侯，逐华阳〕昭王，即秦昭襄王，战国时秦国国君。范雎，战国时魏国人。先被昭王拜为客卿，指出秦昭王母宣太后擅权，权贵用事，将危及昭王的统治。昭王遂下令废宣太后，将穰侯、华阳君等贵戚放逐到关外，并拜范雎为相，封于应（今河南平顶山西），称应侯。穰侯，即魏冉，宣太后异父弟，曾多次任秦相，封于穰（今河南邓州），称穰侯。华阳，即华阳君芈（mǐ）戎，宣太后同父弟，曾任将军等职，与魏冉同掌国政，受封于华阳（今河南新郑北），故称华阳君。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-23"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔公室〕王室。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-24"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔杜私门〕抑制豪门贵族的势力。杜，堵塞、封闭。私门，对公室而言，指权贵大臣之家。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-25"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔向使〕假使。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-26"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔却〕推辞，拒绝。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-27"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔昆山〕昆仑山，古代以出产美玉而闻名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-28"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔随、和之宝〕即随侯珠与和氏璧，传说中春秋时随侯得到的宝珠和楚人卞和所获的美玉。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-29"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔明月〕宝珠名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-30"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔服太阿之剑〕佩带太阿剑。服，佩带。太阿，古代名剑，相传为春秋时著名工匠欧冶子、干将所铸。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-31"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔纤离〕骏马名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-32"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔建翠凤之旗〕树起以翠羽装饰的凤形旗帜。建，树立。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-33"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔灵鼍（tuó）〕即扬子鳄，古人认为有灵性，皮可蒙鼓。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-34"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔犀象之器〕用犀牛角和象牙制成的器具。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-35"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔玩好〕供玩赏的宝物。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-36"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔骏良〕骏马名。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-37"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔西蜀丹青〕蜀地出产的丹青颜料。丹，丹砂，可以制成红色颜料。青，青雘（huò），可以制成青黑色颜料。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-38"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔下陈〕古代殿堂下放置礼品、站列婢妾的地方。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-39"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔宛珠〕宛地出产的宝珠。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-40"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔傅玑之珥（ěr）〕镶嵌着珠子的耳饰。傅，附着、加上。玑，不圆的珠子，这里泛指珠子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-41"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔阿（ē）缟〕古代齐国东阿所产的细绢。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-42"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔随俗雅化〕娴雅变化而能随俗。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-43"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔佳冶〕娇美妖冶。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-44"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔击瓮叩缶（fǒu）〕敲击瓮、缶来奏乐。这是秦国的风俗。瓮，用来汲水的陶器，口小而腹大。缶，一种瓦制的打击乐器。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-45"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔搏髀（bì）〕唱歌时拍打大腿以应和节拍。搏，击打、拍打。髀，大腿。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-46"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔《郑》《卫》《桑间》〕指郑国、卫国一带的乐曲。桑间，原是卫国濮水边的地名，在今河南濮阳南，相传卫国青年男女常在濮水上欢会歌唱。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-47"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔《昭》《虞》《武》《象》〕都是传说中的古乐名，这里泛指古乐。《昭》，即《韶》，传说中舜时的乐曲。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-48"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔适观〕适于观听。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-49"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔人民〕和下文的“众庶”，都是百姓的意思。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-50"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔择〕同“释”，舍弃。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-51"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔就〕成就。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-52"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔充〕丰裕，繁盛。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-53"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔五帝三王〕五帝，《史记·五帝本纪》指黄帝、颛顼（zhuānxū）、帝喾（kù）、唐尧、虞舜。三王，指夏、商、周三代开国君主，即夏禹、商汤和周武王。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-54"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔黔首〕指平民、老百姓。黔，黑。平民百姓以黑巾覆头，故称“黔首”。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-55"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔资〕资助，供给。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-56"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔业〕使成就霸业。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-57"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"〔藉寇兵而赍（jī）盗粮〕给敌人提供武器和粮食。藉，同“借”。赍，送给、付与。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11191-58"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"谏逐客书","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11191-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n李斯","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"臣闻吏议逐客，窃以为过矣。昔缪公","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11191-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"求士，西取由余于戎","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11191-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，东得百里奚于宛","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11191-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，迎蹇叔于宋","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11191-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，来丕豹、公孙支于晋","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11191-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。此五子者，不产于秦，而缪公用之，并","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11191-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"国二十，遂霸西戎。孝公用商鞅之法","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11191-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，移风易俗，民以殷盛","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11191-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，国以富强，百姓乐用","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11191-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，诸侯亲服，获楚、魏之师","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11191-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，举","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-11191-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"地千里，至今治强","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-11191-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。惠王用张仪之计","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-11191-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，拔三川之地","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-11191-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，西并巴、蜀","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-11191-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，北收上郡","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-11191-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，南取汉中","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-11191-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，包九夷","type":"text"},{"label":"[19]","noteId":"footnote-11191-19","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，制鄢、郢，东据成皋之险","type":"text"},{"label":"[20]","noteId":"footnote-11191-20","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，割膏腴之壤，遂散六国之从","type":"text"},{"label":"[21]","noteId":"footnote-11191-21","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，使之西面事秦，功施","type":"text"},{"label":"[22]","noteId":"footnote-11191-22","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"到今。昭王得范雎，废穰侯，逐华阳","type":"text"},{"label":"[23]","noteId":"footnote-11191-23","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，强公室","type":"text"},{"label":"[24]","noteId":"footnote-11191-24","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，杜私门","type":"text"},{"label":"[25]","noteId":"footnote-11191-25","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，蚕食诸侯，使秦成帝业。此四君者，皆以客之功。由此观之，客何负于秦哉！向使","type":"text"},{"label":"[26]","noteId":"footnote-11191-26","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"四君却","type":"text"},{"label":"[27]","noteId":"footnote-11191-27","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"客而不内，疏士而不用，是使国无富利之实而秦无强大之名也。\n\n今陛下致昆山","type":"text"},{"label":"[28]","noteId":"footnote-11191-28","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之玉，有随、和之宝","type":"text"},{"label":"[29]","noteId":"footnote-11191-29","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，垂明月","type":"text"},{"label":"[30]","noteId":"footnote-11191-30","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之珠，服太阿之剑","type":"text"},{"label":"[31]","noteId":"footnote-11191-31","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，乘纤离","type":"text"},{"label":"[32]","noteId":"footnote-11191-32","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之马，建翠凤之旗","type":"text"},{"label":"[33]","noteId":"footnote-11191-33","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，树灵鼍","type":"text"},{"label":"[34]","noteId":"footnote-11191-34","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之鼓。此数宝者，秦不生一焉，而陛下说之，何也？必秦国之所生然后可，则是夜光之璧不饰朝廷，犀象之器","type":"text"},{"label":"[35]","noteId":"footnote-11191-35","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不为玩好","type":"text"},{"label":"[36]","noteId":"footnote-11191-36","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，郑、卫之女不充后宫，而骏良","type":"text"},{"label":"[37]","noteId":"footnote-11191-37","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不实外厩，江南金锡不为用，西蜀丹青","type":"text"},{"label":"[38]","noteId":"footnote-11191-38","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不为采。所以饰后宫、充下陈","type":"text"},{"label":"[39]","noteId":"footnote-11191-39","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"、娱心意、说耳目者，必出于秦然后可，则是宛珠","type":"text"},{"label":"[40]","noteId":"footnote-11191-40","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之簪、傅玑之珥","type":"text"},{"label":"[41]","noteId":"footnote-11191-41","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"、阿缟","type":"text"},{"label":"[42]","noteId":"footnote-11191-42","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之衣、锦绣之饰不进于前，而随俗雅化","type":"text"},{"label":"[43]","noteId":"footnote-11191-43","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"佳冶","type":"text"},{"label":"[44]","noteId":"footnote-11191-44","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"窈窕赵女不立于侧也。夫击瓮叩缶","type":"text"},{"label":"[45]","noteId":"footnote-11191-45","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，弹筝搏髀","type":"text"},{"label":"[46]","noteId":"footnote-11191-46","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，而歌呼呜呜快耳者，真秦之声也；《郑》《卫》《桑间》","type":"text"},{"label":"[47]","noteId":"footnote-11191-47","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，《昭》《虞》《武》《象》","type":"text"},{"label":"[48]","noteId":"footnote-11191-48","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"者，异国之乐也。今弃击瓮叩缶而就《郑》《卫》，退弹筝而取《昭》《虞》，若是者何也？快意当前，适观","type":"text"},{"label":"[49]","noteId":"footnote-11191-49","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"而已矣。今取人则不然，不问可否，不论曲直，非秦者去，为客者逐。然则是所重者在乎色、乐、珠玉，而所轻者在乎人民","type":"text"},{"label":"[50]","noteId":"footnote-11191-50","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"也。此非所以跨海内、制诸侯之术也。\n\n臣闻地广者粟多，国大者人众，兵强则士勇。是以太山不让土壤，故能成其大；河海不择","type":"text"},{"label":"[51]","noteId":"footnote-11191-51","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"细流，故能就","type":"text"},{"label":"[52]","noteId":"footnote-11191-52","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"其深；王者不却众庶，故能明其德。是以地无四方，民无异国，四时充","type":"text"},{"label":"[53]","noteId":"footnote-11191-53","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"美，鬼神降福，此五帝三王","type":"text"},{"label":"[54]","noteId":"footnote-11191-54","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"之所以无敌也。今乃弃黔首","type":"text"},{"label":"[55]","noteId":"footnote-11191-55","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"以资","type":"text"},{"label":"[56]","noteId":"footnote-11191-56","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"敌国，却宾客以业","type":"text"},{"label":"[57]","noteId":"footnote-11191-57","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"诸侯，使天下之士退而不敢西向，裹足不入秦，此所谓“藉寇兵而赍盗粮","type":"text"},{"label":"[58]","noteId":"footnote-11191-58","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"”者也。\n\n夫物不产于秦，可宝者多；士不产于秦，而愿忠者众。今逐客以资敌国，损民以益仇，内自虚而外树怨于诸侯，求国无危，不可得也。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11191-1","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-1","postId":"11191-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-2","postId":"11191-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-3","postId":"11191-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-4","postId":"11191-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-5","postId":"11191-1","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11191-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://fo